  "schoolyard": 1,
  "schoolyard_use_notes": "It has large, star-shaped lobed leaves that offer an introduction to concepts like leaf morphology, photosynthesis, and plant adaptation. The leaves are deciduous and can be incorporated into lessons about seasonality. The leaves and fruits are fun to trace and draw. The dry winged fruits are wind dispersed and helicopter through the air.&nbsp;",
